        "span_2": "Raised beds / Food you actually eat",
        "h1_1": "A 4 × 8 bed.",
        "em_1": "Make it count.",
        "p_1": "What to plant in a 4 × 8 raised bed.",
        "p_2": "Thirty-two square feet can be useful. Choose the kind of meals you want from it, then leave room to grow and get in there.",
        "a_3": "Choose a direction ",
        "span_3": "↗",
        "figcaption_1": "Actual QBL raised bed; dimensions are not established by this photograph.",
